<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</title>
<headline>Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Secretariat weekly estimate, to November 20 of 1995/96 shipments (1996/97 wheat), 1995/96 export commitments (1996/97 wheat) and purchases by exporters in indicated crop years (thousands of tonnes).</p>
<p> ...........shipments..commits..crop year...exporter purchases</p>
<p> .............................................1995/96..1996/97</p>
